OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOccasional
OL,6,Fshowers will continue across western
OL,7,Fareas especially, with a few also
OL,8,Freaching the east coast, though the
OL,9,Fbest of the clear spells will be here.
OL,10,FWinds easing further.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FBright or sunny intervals
OL,13,Fand a few showers mainly in the west.
OL,14,FLess windy and a little milder too.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,17,FThursday will be mainly dry, though
OL,18,Fquite cloudy with a few light showers.
OL,19,FSome sunshine around too. A dry start
OL,20,FFriday then rain spreading from west.
OL,21,FRain easing later Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
